<%# The brand mark: a lime tile with the L followed by the wordmark.

    This partial contains only the mark, without a wrapping link. Its destination
    differs by context: the home page scrolls to #top while subpages navigate to
    root_path.

    The application and public pages share the same size and shape. Only the tile
    color may differ: the sidebar passes `chip_class: 'bg-brand'`, which uses the
    organisation color from BrandHelper and defaults to the same lime-300. %>
<% chip_class = local_assigns.fetch(:chip_class, 'bg-lime-300') %>
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded border text-2xl font-semibold text-black <%= chip_class %> border-black shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#000000] flex items-center justify-center">L</div>
<span class="inline text-black dark:text-white">alabase</span>
